### Global Debug Utilities

When debug mode is active, additional debugging utilities are available via:

```javascript
window.ARIA_DEBUG.critical('Critical error message');
window.ARIA_DEBUG.warn('Warning message');
window.ARIA_DEBUG.error('Error message');
window.ARIA_DEBUG.info('Info message');
window.ARIA_DEBUG.log('Log message');
window.ARIA_DEBUG.debug('Debug message');
```
